Curriculum indicator B8.1.1.1.2
> 🎯 **Learning objectives** By the end of this lesson you should be able to:
- identify graphic tablets, magnetic card readers, optical card readers, QR code readers and RFID readers;
- explain how they work in real-life situations;
- generate a QR code linked to a website.
**Direct data entry (DDE)** devices capture data directly from its source, with little or no typing. They are fast, accurate and suitable for large volumes of data.
